The capital gains inclusion rate also changed this year: gains above $250,000 annually are now taxed at two-thirds rather than one-half. If you hold investments outside your registered accounts or have a corporation holding investments, I want to make sure we''ve reviewed what this means for you.<br><br>
Can we find 30 minutes this month to run through your current picture?<br><br>
[Your Name]<br><br>
